<node id="表单类型">
  <data key="d0">表单类型</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">表单类型refers to the classification of forms into standard and custom types, with custom forms being configurable through the system.&lt;SEP&gt;表单类型是资源列表中的一项字段，用于标识资源的表单类型，如标准或自定义。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4ad8acb2f5dc7c34850a1b7551650b</data>
