<node id="资源">
  <data key="d0">资源</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">资源is the smallest business unit that can be issued and authorized within an application, typically a single data object resource such as "training records" or "paper records".&lt;SEP&gt;资源是教师发展一级菜单下的应用菜单，用户可在此页面进行操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37d70258cd3425e97aed253665baac35</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1780036815</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="数据对象">
  <data key="d0">数据对象</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">数据对象是系统中用于存储和管理数据的结构，每个数据对象对应一个表单。&lt;SEP&gt;数据对象is the business entity corresponding to a resource, defined by the development side, including a unique object code and a set of fields.&lt;SEP&gt;数据对象是资源配置中的核心概念，每个数据对象对应一个表单。&lt;SEP&gt;数据对象是系统中存储数据的基本单元，用于关联字段。&lt;SEP&gt;数据对象是指表单中关联的实体，如关联人员。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37bf96402015c1a3fc583c5e3fc554a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18512f38d43fa875be12793e3f45ce6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed43fd2cf6ce6a4fbd6e05236731ce0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4ad8acb2f5dc7c34850a1b7551650b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1780036815</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="字段">
  <data key="d0">字段</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">字段refers to data items within a data object, categorized into platform-defined fields, tenant-customizable fields, and related business fields.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1780036815</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="审批流应用">
  <data key="d0">审批流应用</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">审批流应用是一种应用类型，用于管理审批流程。&lt;SEP&gt;审批流应用is an independent application that manages the approval process, defining approvers, actions, and field permissions at each node.&lt;SEP&gt;审批流应用是新增的应用之一，影响平台端和管理端的审批流配置菜单。&lt;SEP&gt;审批流应用是用于流程审批的软件应用，通常包含多个审批步骤。&lt;SEP&gt;审批流应用是系统中提供审批流程功能的应用。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37bf96402015c1a3fc583c5e3fc554a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05017a3c4067da5fbe2670118101855f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4ad8acb2f5dc7c34850a1b7551650b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2784f4fe9cea16e81aaad3d2d8cdac27</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1780036815</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
