  <data key="d0">字段权限</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">字段权限refers to the configuration of field visibility, editability, and required status within an approval node, applicable only to that specific node.&lt;SEP&gt;字段权限是控制表单字段是否可见和可编辑的配置，影响数据在审批过程中的展示和操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68f98d20334da6fa7758c7f5fc34c477</data>
