  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">开发端is one of the system ends mentioned, referring to the development side of the application.&lt;SEP&gt;开发端is the development end of the system, with a link to the prototype.&lt;SEP&gt;开发端是系统的一个组成部分，用于开发和维护功能。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f96b9b4820270df5e342fb13bb472f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6af1d56bc6e64532dd9c637ca2a0b6ea</data>
