<node id="租户管理端">
  <data key="d0">租户管理端</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">租户管理端is a specific location within the tenant's environment, used for form and approval flow configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;租户管理端is the tenant management end of the system, with a link to the prototype.&lt;SEP&gt;租户管理端是租户用于管理其账户和配置的后台界面。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6af1d56bc6e64532dd9c637ca2a0b6ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2784f4fe9cea16e81aaad3d2d8cdac27</data>
