<node id="关联业务字段">
  <data key="d0">关联业务字段</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">关联业务字段是用于将当前字段与其它表单或数据进行关联的功能。&lt;SEP&gt;关联业务字段are fields related to business operations, such as basic information.&lt;SEP&gt;关联业务字段是与业务字段相关联的字段。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c09c81eebbc91192309a75c11c39b55b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed43fd2cf6ce6a4fbd6e05236731ce0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05017a3c4067da5fbe2670118101855f</data>
